{
  "contract_version": "0.1",
  "authority": "wink",
  "pack_version": "wink 0.2.0",
  "scope_note": "Verification contract for the wink authority (verification experiment, 2026-10-08). Each check names the authority item it verifies, its verifiability classification, a verification mode, and minimal deterministic assertions. REVIEW entries are surfaced as REVIEW_REQUIRED and are never faked into PASS. Instrument styling (body.marks-on, .mark-toggle, #provPanel, .prov-*) is review tooling, not app UI, and is excluded from palette scans.",
